FORM K-1.
IN THE MATTER OF: ouroboros.
OFF THE RECORD: Send each increment back to the same case. The bound stops the
OFF THE RECORD: loop after five values.

ARTICLE 1.
    AWAIT SUMMONS, FILED UNDER n.
    PROCLAIM n.
    SHOULD n FAIL TO EXCEED 4, SERVE NOTICE OF n PLUS 1 UPON THE CASE AT BAR.
    SHOULD n FAIL TO EXCEED 4, REFER TO ARTICLE 1.
    ADJOURN INDEFINITELY.
